        <hgroup>
            <h3>We use <span class="highlight-txt">Cookies</span></h3>
            <p>We use cookies to enhance your experience&period; By continuing to visit this progressive web app (PWA) you agree to our use of cookies&period; To find out more about the cookies we use&comma; see our <a href="/cookie-policy/" title="Cookie policy">Cookie policy</a>&period;</p>
            <p>If you decline&comma; your information won&apos;t be tracked when you visit this progressive web app (PWA)&period; A single cookie will be used in your browser to remember your preference not to be tracked&period;</p>
        </hgroup>
        <div class="cookie-actions">
